"""Typed price-cage rules and exact limit-price range calculations.

This module calculates only a configured price-submission boundary. A result
marked ``NOT_APPLICABLE`` is not evidence that an order is otherwise tradable.
The owning rule configuration must supply every market-specific parameter.
"""

